  "conclusions": [
    "All audited local product/server and CLI outputs and the six cloud WuKongIM ELF outputs report compiler Go1.25.11. Host dispatcher Go1.23.4 is not the actual compiler of these outputs.",
    "Local native outputs differ from cloud in GOOS/GOARCH, CGO=1 versus 0, and absent versus true trimpath. These are environment/configuration differences, not an established performance root cause.",
    "Local VCS a804 stamps are explained by Go1.25.11 ignoring ordinary .git files in nested worktrees; actual compiled source witnesses point into the worktree and include post-a804 79a logic.",
    "Third-party Caddy, Prometheus and node_exporter Go1.26.x metadata belongs to those separately pinned dependencies, not the product compiler."
  ]
}
